    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p><b>Base Item:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber_(Weapon)\" title=\"Lightsaber (Weapon)\">Lightsaber</a> (<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lambent_Crystal\" title=\"Lambent Crystal\">Lambent Crystal</a>) </p><p><b>Heirloom Bonus:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Symbol_of_the_Light\" title=\"Symbol of the Light\">Symbol of the Light</a> </p><p>After Anakin Solo dies on the planet <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Myrkr\" title=\"Myrkr\">Myrkr</a>, his <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber_(Weapon)\" title=\"Lightsaber (Weapon)\">Lightsaber</a> finds its way into the hands of Ganner Rhysode and even Anakin's uncle, Luke Skywalker, who wields it in a duel against Supreme Overlord Shimrra. The Weapon is returned to Han Solo, who lays his son's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber_(Weapon)\" title=\"Lightsaber (Weapon)\">Lightsaber</a> to rest in Chewbacca's memorial tree on <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Kashyyyk\" title=\"Kashyyyk\">Kashyyyk</a>. </p><p>In the Legacy era, Anakin Solo's Lightsaber could fall into the hands of a Jedi Padawan sent on a special mission to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Kashyyyk\" title=\"Kashyyyk\">Kashyyyk</a> to retrieve the weapon as a rite of passage for reaching knighthood. </p><p><b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lambent_Crystal\" title=\"Lambent Crystal\">Lambent Crystal</a>:</b> Wielders of this Lightsaber ignore the normal penalties when using the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Sense_Force\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sense Force\">Sense Force</a> and&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Sense_Surroundings\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sense Surroundings\">Sense Surroundings</a>&nbsp;applications of the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a>&nbsp;Skill to sense&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Yuuzhan_Vong\" title=\"Yuuzhan Vong\">Yuuzhan Vong</a>. </p><p><b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Symbol_of_the_Light\" title=\"Symbol of the Light\">Symbol of the Light</a>:</b> Once per encounter, as a&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reaction</a>, the wielder can impose a penalty on any one attack roll or&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skill Check\">Skill Check</a>&nbsp;made by a character with a&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dark_Side_Score\" title=\"Dark Side Score\">Dark Side Score</a>&nbsp;of 1 or higher. This penalty is equal to the target's&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dark_Side_Score\" title=\"Dark Side Score\">Dark Side Score</a>. </p><p><b>Special:</b>&nbsp;Can be&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Thrown\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Thrown\">Thrown</a> </p>",
